# Paths that decide what gets staged and released.
#
# A change to any of these can release code to the registry: the workflow is what
# stages the release, and the manifests decide what the tarball contains. They must
# never be merged without the maintainer reviewing them, even once the repository
# has other people with write access.
/.github/**                @danielbdev
/package.json              @danielbdev
/package-lock.json         @danielbdev
/packages/*/package.json   @danielbdev
